  (text "19-wire wheel harness: J8.N to J9.N (17 wires).\nPins 1 and 17 are shared GND; pin 16 is +3V3.\nPower J10/J11: 1 ACT_5V, 2 GND. Three shared grounds total."
    (at 20 22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "06604a64-5963-5348-ae6b-6f79999ea369"))
  (text "Unplugged wheel fault return defaults LOW through R141.\nMISO inputs have local idle bias; select signals retain main-side pullups.\nEncoder stays on main J6 directly to J7; it does not cross this harness.\nNo power is carried across breakaway tabs. Do not hot plug."
    (at 20 238 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "bfec5523-9f8d-54a0-ba2c-28141be4f46d"))
